# JARVIS — local environment variables (PRIVATE — never commit this file)
# This file is gitignored. It holds secret keys and credentials.

# =====================================================================
# LLM Brain (OpenRouter)
# =====================================================================
# Sign up (free tier available) at https://openrouter.ai/ and create an
# API key. It looks like:  sk-or-v1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-openrouter-key-here

# =====================================================================
# Email (Gmail via SMTP)
# =====================================================================
# Your Gmail address (the sender).
EMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com

# App Password (NOT your regular Gmail password).
# Create one at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# After creating, paste the 16-character password below (no spaces).
EMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

# =====================================================================
# WARNING: This project lives under OneDrive/Desktop on the developer's
# machine. Any key placed in a real .env file is automatically synced to
# Microsoft cloud and to every device signed in to the same account.
# Treat it as compromised the moment you save it. For anything beyond a
# free-tier demo key, use Windows Credential Manager instead.
# =====================================================================
